# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Project Pauli operators onto Hilbert subspaces for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Proyeksikan operator Pauli ke subruang Hilbert untuk versi terbaru Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Project Pauli operators onto Hilbert subspaces"
msgstr "Proyeksikan operator Pauli ke subruang Hilbert"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/project-pauli-operators-onto-hilbert-subspaces.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We show different ways of projecting a weighted linear combination of Pauli strings\n"
"into a subspace defined by a subset of size $d$ computational basis states. The\n"
"projected operator is stored as a $d \\times d$ ``scipy.sparse.coo_matrix``.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita tunjukkan beberapa cara memproyeksikan kombinasi linear berbobot dari string Pauli\n"
"ke subruang yang didefinisikan oleh himpunan bagian berukuran $d$ dari keadaan basis komputasi. Operator\n"
"terproyeksi disimpan sebagai ``scipy.sparse.coo_matrix`` berukuran $d \\times d$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As an example, we consider the Hamiltonian of the one-dimensional Heisenberg model with periodic\n"
"boundary conditions and $L = 22$ spins:\n"
"$$\n"
"H = \\sum_{\\langle i, j \\rangle}\\left( \\sigma^x_i\\sigma^x_j + \\sigma^y_i\\sigma^y_j + \\sigma^z_i\\sigma^z_j \\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai contoh, kita pakai Hamiltonian model Heisenberg satu dimensi dengan kondisi batas\n"
"periodik dan $L = 22$ spin:\n"
"$$\n"
"H = \\sum_{\\langle i, j \\rangle}\\left( \\sigma^x_i\\sigma^x_j + \\sigma^y_i\\sigma^y_j + \\sigma^z_i\\sigma^z_j \\right).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package provides two tools to perform this projection:\n"
msgstr "Paket ini menyediakan dua alat untuk melakukan proyeksi ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.matrix_elements_from_pauli()``: a lower-level function that returns the non-zero matrix elements of a Pauli string and the corresponding indices of the non-zero elements.\n"
msgstr "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.matrix_elements_from_pauli()``: fungsi tingkat rendah yang mengembalikan elemen matriks tak-nol dari sebuah string Pauli beserta indeks elemen tak-nol yang bersesuaian.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.project_operator_to_subspace()``: a higher-level function that directly returns a ``scipy.sparse`` matrix.\n"
msgstr "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.project_operator_to_subspace()``: a higher-level function that directly returns a ``scipy.sparse`` matrix.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use these two tools to produce the same sparse operator.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan cara memakai kedua alat tersebut untuk menghasilkan operator sparse yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subspace definition {#subspace-definition}"
msgstr "Definisi subruang {#subspace-definition}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For this example we generate length-22 random bitstrings. For the projection\n"
"functions to work as expected, it is essential that the bitstrings that define\n"
"the subspace are unique and sorted in ascending order according to their unsigned\n"
"integer representation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk contoh ini kita membangkitkan bitstring acak dengan panjang 22. Agar fungsi proyeksi\n"
"bekerja sesuai harapan, bitstring yang mendefinisikan\n"
"subruang harus unik dan terurut menaik berdasarkan representasi\n"
"bilangan bulat tak bertandanya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This can be achieved with the ``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.sort_and_remove_duplicates()``\n"
"function.\n"
msgstr "Hal ini bisa dilakukan dengan fungsi ``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.sort_and_remove_duplicates()``.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "First method: nonzero matrix elements and indices {#first-method-nonzero-matrix-elements-and-indices}"
msgstr "Metode pertama: elemen matriks tak-nol dan indeks {#first-method-nonzero-matrix-elements-and-indices}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Higher-level implementation {#higher-level-implementation}"
msgstr "Implementasi tingkat tinggi {#higher-level-implementation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that both implementations yield the same `coo_matrix`:\n"
msgstr "Pastikan kedua implementasi menghasilkan `coo_matrix` yang sama:\n"
